cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this formalization, cite it together with the source paper.
type: software
title: "Freezing growth for random recursive trees: Lean formalization"
repository-code: https://github.com/igor-kortchemski/freezing-growth-rrt
authors:
  - family-names: "Kortchemski"
    given-names: "Igor"
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  Lean 4 / Mathlib formalization of arXiv:2505.16571v2. The 85-item source
  inventory has 82 proved claims and retains three research questions as open.
  Fresh builds and permitted-axiom audits pass. The five Introduction exports
  pass local sandboxed Comparator with Lean and NanoDa. Full Palomar
  verification and public upload are deferred; see the verification record.
keywords:
  - random recursive trees
  - freezing
  - stochastic domination
  - formal verification
  - Lean
